data.value:
Please modify this category snippet library file according to the rules below (change only this file; keep valid JSON): Path: {0}
Rules: 1. Root must be a JSON array; each element is one snippet. 2. Required per item: id (GUID, e.g. 32 hex digits), name (non-empty). 3. Common fields: abbr (abbreviation, may be empty), body, useVariables (whether {{variable}} placeholders are processed), outputMode ("" | "paste" | "paste-enter" | "copy"; empty follows global settings). 4. Optional: imagePath, codeFormat, createdAt, updatedAt. 5. Do not change index.json or other category files.
Example: [ {{ "id": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef", "name": "Example", "abbr": "ex", "body": "Hello", "useVariables": false, "outputMode": "" }} ]
